[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i407"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"第二天，我来到海湾处。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"呆呆地望着帆船。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i405"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还不像海盗船。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这艘改装了一半的船，会被怎么处理呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总不能就这么一直丢着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"到时候大概会被处理掉吧。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i407"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我就这么抬头望着船。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"如果，真的按鸥想象的一样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"如果穿过洞窟……来到的这个港湾，真有海盗船的话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"如果鸥想安排的这一切可以完成的话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我一定会很感动。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"会非常佩服她。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她想出的点子真是惊人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是时间不够。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一点一点逐步进行的准备工作，在最后阶段停下了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"明明只要让她在这里再度过一个夏天，就可以完成了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就一个夏天……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我不知道鸥到底去了哪里，还能不能和她相见。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只是，我还有一件事情可以做。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我拨通了电话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是为防万一而留给我的电话号码。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘你好，这里是久岛家。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“您好，我是鹰原。前几天打扰您了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘啊，鹰原。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那个，在那之后……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘你去调查过船上了吗。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是，是的。我找到了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“找到了她的宝物。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘是吗……’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘那本书发售后过了一段时间……’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘我从看了书的小读者们那里，收到了许多的信件。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘当然并不是所有的信全是写给那孩子的。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘也有单纯的读后感。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘还有写给我这个作者的。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘……只是其中，也有给鸥的信。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘是寄给故事主角鸥的信。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘鸥似乎对此感到高兴地不得了。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘对她来说，这些信就像是寄给自己的一样吧。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘对没有和朋友一起玩耍过的那孩子来说，这是第一次和外面的人们交流。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘反反复复不知疲倦地，读着那些信。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘接着，那孩子……给那些寄给鸥的信写了回信。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“回信，难道……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“写了‘10年后，我会邀请你来参加终极冒险’。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘唉。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘你怎么会知道的。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我小时候也寄出过信。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“然后收到了回信。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘是吗。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘鹰原，也写了信。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘……’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘太好了。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘这是那孩子的梦想。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘在那里造一艘海盗船。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘接着，邀请大家过来玩。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘我本以为那个梦想已经无法实现了。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘但是你出现了。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘你找到了我和鸥所准备的地方。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘我们的努力有了回报。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……为什么。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘？’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“为什么是在10年后啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“当时邀请不就好了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“收到信的时候，只要回信说地点在这里就好了啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“要是当时的话，肯定会有很多人兴冲冲过来的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘你说的这点，我也提过。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘但是，鸥不愿意。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“鸥吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":515,"image":"i25658"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1258"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘因为她是小说里鸥的原型。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘担心别人看到自己的样子，会不会很失望。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘不想被人看到自己连路都走不稳，总是痛苦地躺在床上的样子吧。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘这样的她，竟然是鸥的原型，她一定不想被人知道吧。’"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1267"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘等到身体好了。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘等到自己变成像鸥一样能带领大家的女孩子了。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘届时再见面就好了。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘那孩子是这样想的。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘她一定……很害怕吧。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘害怕直接和人见面。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘确实，那段时间的鸥连走路都成问题。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘虽然那孩子在我的面前话挺多的，但是叫她去参加个小型交流会也是坚决不去的。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘是个内向的孩子。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘但是，真的很努力。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘身体渐渐好转了。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘变得像普通孩子一样，可以自由活动了。’"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":515},{"op":"clear","layer":259},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘但是2年之前，那孩子又不能走动了。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘那孩子没有把如此珍视的信件带到国外去。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘可能是因为带在身边，只会徒增痛苦吧。’"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对了，我有一个请求。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘？’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……我把我的想法，告诉了鹭阿姨。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘这……’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不可以吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘不。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘我知道了。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘鹰原。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘那艘船就送给你了。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉!؟不是……这个……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘你想要做的事情。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘为了让它能够实现，让我也尽一份绵力。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘帮助孩子……’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘去实现梦想……’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘对大人而言是无上的喜悦。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“非常感谢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那么，我有一个小小的请求想要拜托您。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"‘请说。’"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i15"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15064"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10143"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11708"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i12140"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“希望你们能陪我去一个地方。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15081"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10145"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11730"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i12173"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“难道又是那个洞窟？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，是穿过洞窟所到的地方。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10242"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那里有什么吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“去了就知道了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15071"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10253"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11711"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i12149"},{"op":"text","speaker":"一同","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i12150"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“比起穿过洞窟还是坐船比较快，能不能捎上我们？”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i12171"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“这倒无所谓……”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“羽依里……突然变得好积极。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i12188"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“有点心动。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i12162"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“刚来岛上时那么沉默内向的羽依里竟然……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“有吗؟؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15096"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“我还记得你看到我特训时候退缩的样子。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没有退缩，只是普通地吓到了而已。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15106"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“什么意思！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11771"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“总之就是说鹰原也习惯这座岛上的事物了吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12188"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“全裸的那天也快来了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“来个鬼啊！”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":769},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i407"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“这里……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12171"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“不是七浜吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“七浜？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你知道吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“在渔夫之间还挺知名的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“这里，其实是私人海滩。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12141"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“简单来说就是私人土地。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12150"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“所以不可以擅自闯进来的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我获得许可了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“许可是……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“于是，叫你们过来，是希望你们帮我整修一艘船。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":0},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i405"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就是那艘。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15037"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“那是……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10242"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“的确很破呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12149"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“叫我们帮忙整修……说到底，这是谁的船啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“其实，这艘船是我的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10217"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“哎哎。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12209"},{"op":"image","layer":6,"image":"i25241"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“你小子，是有钱人吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“其实是我获得了真正船主的许可，在这个夏天可以自由使用这艘船。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“所以，短期间内……这艘船等于是我的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11730"},{"op":"clear","layer":6},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“是谁啊，你说的船主。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“有钱人。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10289"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那自然是有钱人。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i407"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11789"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“鹰原……你到底是什么人。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“企业的间谍吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11787"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“你来岛上到底是为了做什么……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“哈，哈。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不要把水枪对着我。也别抱有奇怪的疑惑。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这艘船是……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我本想说出鸥的事情，但话到嘴边停下来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说不定会引起不必要的混乱。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我想把这艘船做成海盗船。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12168"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“什么。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“把这艘船做成海盗船之后，想怎么样呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“什么怎么样，很厉害不是吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“会很激动不是吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15011"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“厉害是厉害的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“之后……我想给某个人看。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i10203"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“给某个人看？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“鸥。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i10270"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……谁啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“之前和我在一起的吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15017"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“谁啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你们应该见过啊。拖着个行李箱……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12150"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“有那样的人吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15008"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“不知道啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这样啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i10226"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“是谁啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12188"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“女孩子吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15038"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i10285"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“哎呀呀。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12180"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“他可能被甩了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i11777"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“为了让人家回头，才搞这么大手笔？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15110"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“好有激情呀。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，不是的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"好吧，其实也不算全错。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……嗯？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我被甩了吗。怎么可能。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是这样的……我并没有……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15011"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“你满脸通红地扭捏个什么劲啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10282"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“不是挺好的嘛。那种经历。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12162"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“嗯。为一个女孩子而制作一艘船。十分有激情了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12188"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“值得学习。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i11750"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“嗯嗯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i11753"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“少子化社会里就需要这种性情。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“别，别若无其事地开黄腔啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i11718"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我并没有想那种事情。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i11701"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“谁，谁都没开黄腔呀。你脸别红。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i11761"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“少子化可是该认真考虑的问题。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12150"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“知道了知道了。小孩子就别把什么少子化挂在嘴边了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i11701"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“我不是小孩子。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10200"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“好像很有趣的样子。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“做做看吧。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":769},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i477"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不知不觉中，海湾变得热闹起来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们从早上开始，就在海湾继续推进鸥进行了一半的船的整修作业。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和效果图进行了对照……现在还没有船帆。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"除此之外的外观和内饰倒是都做得很漂亮了。"},{"op":"image","layer":256,"image":"i405"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"其实要搞定桅杆的作业还是挺危险的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"要调查杆子是不是烂掉了，需要系上救生索慢慢往上爬。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"确认悬挂绳索部分的强度，要是有问题，还得一次次修改。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所幸这座岛上有不少懂船的人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"即使出现了良一都不明白的地方，也可以听取多方意见慎重推进工作。"},{"op":"clear","layer":256},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i407"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我把鸥的行李箱放在了船上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"时不时会让我有种鸥就坐在那里的感觉。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感觉她正看着我们。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“我已经凭·关系网搞来不少东西了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12141"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“可还是有几个地方必须弄新部件来。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12147"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“特别是扬帆时候用到的绳索和固定件，不能用旧的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“大概要多少钱？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12171"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“嗯，我粗略估算了一下，大概这个数吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"价格不便宜啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“知道了。我商量看看。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10203"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“跟谁商量？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“赞助商。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11789"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“鹰原，你……果然……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“都说了我不是企业的间谍了。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i409"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“喂，我回去了哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“你别把自己搞太累了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，但是时间不多了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12171"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“对哦。暑假结束你就要回去了吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“要是今年完不成，明年再来就好了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“这艘船还是会在这里的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是，那样是不行的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我的心中有一股说不上来的焦急。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也许是暑假快结束的缘故吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总之要抓紧时间了。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i410"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…………"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“咦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大家回去之后我依然独自留下来作业……不知不觉中周围已经一片黑暗了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为精神过于集中，没注意到太阳已经落山了吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“糟了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"明明良一再三唠叨，让我天黑之前回去的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"千叮咛万嘱咐说晚上不要开摩托艇。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且我自己也没有晚上出海的勇气。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"穿过洞窟爬过山就更别提了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这么一来……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"回不去了啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"算了，今晚就睡在这里吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"船长室里有一张勉强可以躺人的沙发。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也有准备好的饮料和点心。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i171"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"简单对付着吃了一顿后，赶紧躺下。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i149"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"耳边回响着波浪的声音……"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我很快就进入了梦乡。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…………"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i171"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……突然醒了过来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感觉好像听到船上有什么声音。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是波浪声吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……不对。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那是有东西在船上移动的声音。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嘎啦嘎啦……重物拖行的声音。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是最近听得很熟悉的声音……"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i171"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我离开船长室来到甲板。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"夜晚的冷风，吹过我的脸。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我发现有人站在甲板上。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1279"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1278"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“鸥……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"被放在甲板上的行李箱。箱子的旁边，鸥站在那里。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1280"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“呀。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“你醒啦？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“应该是醒了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可我是不是在做梦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1278"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“说不定是在梦境中吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这无所谓。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“到底去哪里了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“我哪儿都没去。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“一直，在这里看着你。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“一直都在看着。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真是的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我有好多话想说。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不管是钥匙还是船。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“都是你准备好的吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1281"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“抱，抱歉。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“但是，我自己也忘了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“忘了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“全都忘记了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“我身在国外的医院，每天基本都是在睡梦中度过的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“渐渐地，我变得分不清梦境和现实……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“然后，真实和谎言的界线也变得模糊起来。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1276"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“妈妈……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“我想再见到大家。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“大家还好吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“还会……记得我吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“鸥？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“我要好起来……去见大家。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“那艘海盗船，不知道还在不在啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“藏起来的钥匙，会不会还留着呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“毕竟都过了10年了呢……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“但是，我感觉都还在的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“不管地图，钥匙……还是海盗船一定都还在。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“我们还要再次探险，再次相见。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1278"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“好神奇啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“我躺在床上……小说中才有的回忆，不知不觉中变成了真正的回忆。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“这个夏天……我……来到了小岛上。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“和妈妈带来的行李箱一起。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“追寻着我的梦想。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“我自己也成为了梦想的一部分。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“真正地成为了小说女主角那个鸥。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“也一心认为曾经的冒险是真正存在的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“我本是为了见到10年前的朋友们，才来到这座岛上的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“找到曾经留在这座岛上的地图。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“然后，再次去到秘密的场所。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“我觉得这样的话，是不是就能见到大家了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1281"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“但是，和你到达这艘船的时候我想起来了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“这一切都是小说中的故事。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“我把这些当作是真正的回忆。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“很奇怪吧，明明是自己准备的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“直到2年前……我和妈妈，都一直在这里做着准备。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1275"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“真正的我……并不在这里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“在遥远的国度沉睡。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“当我回忆起这一切的时候，便从你眼前消失了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“现在的我，肯定也是像梦境一样的存在。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“我一直在做的梦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“和朋友们一起，在夏天探险。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1278"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“我想把那次探险，变成真正的回忆。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“而不是只存在于小说中。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“我有了朋友。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“然后终有一天与他们重逢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“做许多快乐的事情。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“也许是为了实现这个梦想，这个夏天我才会来到这里吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“然后。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1282"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“羽依里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“多亏了你，我的梦想实现了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1278"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“和你一起在岛上探险我非常开心。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“非常满足。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“我想，这便是那时候我从你眼前消失的原因。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那么我被你耍了团团转也值得了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“然后你看到我们在改造船，又想要一起参与进来吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可以啊。人手越多越好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这本身就是你开的头。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1281"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“不是的……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“不是这样。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“我已经非常满足了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“已经没关系了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“现在，我会在你的眼前出现。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“是因为我无论如何都想最后见你一面。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“最后？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1278"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“听我说。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“我是来道别的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“我必须得走了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“去哪里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“鸥的话，应该是在国外吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是要回到那里去吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“不。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鸥轻轻地摇了摇头。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i171"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后抬起了头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仰望着那繁星闪烁的深邃夜空。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“更加。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“遥远的地方。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“遥远的地方……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1282"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“羽依里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“谢谢你。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“谢谢你实现了我的梦想。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“还有。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“谢谢你成为了我的朋友。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鸥向我探出了身子。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1284"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"彼此的脸庞也逐渐贴近。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我伸出手轻抚她的脸颊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在夜色中早已变得冰冷的手心，感受到的是切实的温暖。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就连心中，也是一样的温暖。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们……就在这夜色之中……相拥而吻。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…………"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“我知道了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“‘胸咳咳’的意思。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那，那个是……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“你好几次想开口说的话。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“想要说‘凶残至极的可爱’，却忍不住咳嗽了吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“唉嘿嘿。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然说错了，但可能真是这样。"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i171"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我睁开眼，眼前已空无一人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"唯有波浪，依然低声回荡。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是做梦吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不，我不会再去想这种事了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这个夏天发生的事，即使是梦境即使是幻觉。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也要为我坚信的事物，花费剩余的时间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就这样度过暑假吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我就这样眺望着漆黑的海面。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一直到黎明来临。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]